# RESTLESS: one walking pace, 7/8 of a pixel a frame, no running and no
# momentum. One fixed jump: a tap and a held button go exactly as high, and
# once off the ground the pad only turns him, it never steers. Every
# landing freezes him for 14 frames.
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
expect px256 == 18432
hold RIGHT 32
expect px256 == 25600
expect face == 1
expect ground == 1
# a tap of the jump: up 40 pixels at most
press B 1
waituntil ground == 1 80
expect lag > 0
expect py == 144
# straight up, then RIGHT and LEFT in the air: he only turns
wait 20
expect lag == 0
press B 1
expect ground == 0
hold LEFT 10
expect px256 == 25600
expect face == -1
hold RIGHT 10
expect px256 == 25600
expect face == 1
waituntil ground == 1 80
# the landing freeze: walking does nothing for 14 frames
expect lag == 14
hold RIGHT 13
expect px256 == 25600
hold RIGHT 4
expect px256 > 25600
# a held jump goes no higher than a tap: measure both at the top
wait 20
press B 1
wait 17
expect py == 105
waituntil ground == 1 80
wait 20
hold B 20
expect py == 105
waituntil ground == 1 80
release B
# a running jump carries the walking pace and no more
wait 20
hold RIGHT 2
hold RIGHT B 2
hold RIGHT 36
expect ground == 0
